<!-- ========== 能力 ========== -->
<section id="skills">
  <div class="sec-head reveal" data-en="<span class='sec-index'>01 / SKILLS</span><h2 class='sec-title'>Core Competencies</h2><div class='sec-line'></div>"><span class="sec-index">01 / SKILLS</span><h2 class="sec-title">核心竞争力</h2><div class="sec-line"></div></div>
  <div class="skills">
    <div class="skill reveal" data-en="<div class='skill-num'>01</div><h3>Brand Strategy &amp; Communications</h3><p>Led overall hotel brand image building and annual communication strategy; drove brand diagnosis and strategic upgrade, overseeing visual identity reshaping — VI optimization, key visual refresh and standardized collateral design — for unified online-offline brand touchpoints; owned creative review and quality control of all published visuals to meet group brand audit requirements.</p>"><div class="skill-num">01</div><h3>品牌战略与传播</h3><p>主导酒店整体品牌形象塑造与年度传播策略落地，主导酒店品牌形象诊断与战略升级，统筹品牌视觉体系重塑——VI 系统优化、主视觉更新、宣传物料标准化设计，实现线上线下品牌触点的统一输出，显著提升品牌识别度与市场认知；把控所有出街画面的创意审核及品质管理，确保符合集团品牌审计要求。</p></div>
    <div class="skill reveal" data-en="<div class='skill-num'>02</div><h3>Livestream &amp; KOL Matrix</h3><p>Built the hotel's Douyin operation from zero in 2022, growing followers 10x (1K→10K); created the series &quot;MC Speaks&quot; — 100 short videos a year, peak single-video UV 22K and 3 local trending placements; pioneered the &quot;KOL matrix livestream commerce&quot; model, delivering 63 livestreams with self-broadcast GMV over ¥3M and nearly ¥6M in KOL verified sales.</p>"><div class="skill-num">02</div><h3>直播与达人矩阵操盘</h3><p>2022 年从 0 搭建酒店抖音运营体系，实现粉丝量 10 倍增长（1K→10K）；打造栏目「MC 有话说」，全年产出 100 条高品质短视频，最高单条 UV 2.2 万、3 次登榜同城热点；创新「达人矩阵直播带货」模式，带队完成 63 场直播，自播 GMV 超 300 万，联动达人实现总核销额近 600 万。</p></div>
    <div class="skill reveal" data-en="<div class='skill-num'>03</div><h3>Full-funnel Content Operations</h3><p>Managed the WeChat / Weibo / RED / Douyin matrix with differentiated content strategies and publishing rhythm, connecting the &quot;content seeding — engagement — arrival &amp; conversion&quot; funnel; self-created Douyin hashtags reached 2M views, and KOL collaboration produced nearly 1,000 videos across platforms with about ¥4M in KOL video GMV; ran regular UGC campaigns and the &quot;one photo a day&quot; strategy to sustain brand recall and fan activity.</p>"><div class="skill-num">03</div><h3>全域内容运营</h3><p>统管微信、微博、小红书、抖音等自媒体矩阵，制定差异化内容策略与发布节奏，优化内容生产与发布流程，打通「内容种草—互动引流—到店转化」链路；自创抖音话题标签浏览 200 万，联动达人产出全网近 1000 条视频，达人视频 GMV 约 400 万；定期策划落地 UGC 主题活动，推行「每日一图」高频宣发，持续强化品牌记忆与粉丝活跃度。</p></div>
    <div class="skill reveal" data-en="<div class='skill-num'>04</div><h3>Media &amp; Resource Integration</h3><p>Built a Hainan media &amp; KOL resource pool covering Douyin, NetEase, Sina and more; maintained solid partnerships with the Sanya Culture &amp; Tourism Bureau, Tourism Promotion Bureau and Sanya Radio; introduced data-driven PR — sentiment monitoring, media value assessment and campaign analytics — to continuously optimize media placement and support award submissions.</p>"><div class="skill-num">04</div><h3>媒体与资源整合</h3><p>沉淀海南区域媒体与达人资源库，覆盖抖音、网易、新浪等平台；建立并维护与旅游类媒体、生活方式 KOL 及本地新闻渠道的良好合作关系，推动高质量内容合作与奖项申报；与三亚市文旅局、旅游推广局、三亚广播电台等机构建立稳定合作关系，系统性优化媒体数据库；引入数据化公关思维，通过舆情监测、媒体价值评估与传播效果数据分析持续优化媒体投放策略。</p></div>
    <div class="skill reveal" data-en="<div class='skill-num'>05</div><h3>AI Application</h3><p>Skilled at using large AI models to produce web pages, mini-programs and other digital content, and independently completing design work — social media graphics, event posters, collateral and short-video visuals — significantly shortening production cycles; exploring innovative formats (short video, livestream, interactive H5) with hot-topic marketing and data insights.</p>"><div class="skill-num">05</div><h3>AI 应用能力</h3><p>熟练运用 AI 大模型制作网页、小程序等数字化内容，并可独立完成基础设计稿——社媒配图、活动海报、宣传物料与短视频画面，显著压缩内容与物料的产出周期；探索创新内容形式（短视频、直播、互动 H5），结合热点营销及数据洞察优化传播策略。</p></div>
    <div class="skill reveal" data-en="<div class='skill-num'>06</div><h3>Integrated Marketing &amp; Event Planning</h3><p>Coordinated online-offline integrated marketing, leading occasion campaigns, sports-event support and event marketing: launched the official RED annual KOL campaign, led the 8th anniversary &amp; Spring Festival creative check-ins, and joined brand promotion for the 6th Asian Beach Games; planned the Christmas Mermaid themed feast; led F&amp;B packaging upgrade and lifted online conversion through Meituan ROS optimization and targeted placement advice.</p>"><div class="skill-num">06</div><h3>整合营销与活动全案</h3><p>统筹线上线下整合营销，主导节点主题营销、赛事接待配套宣传与事件营销：落地官方小红书年度达人活动，主导 8 周年庆及春节主题创意打卡，参与第六届亚洲沙滩运动会（亚沙会）品牌宣传推广；策划圣诞美人鱼主题盛宴等线下活动，牵头餐饮板块包装升级，通过美团 ROS 分数优化及精准投放建议助力线上转化率提升。</p></div>
  </div>
</section>

