<!-- ========== 经历 ========== -->
<section id="career">
  <div class="sec-head reveal" data-en="<span class='sec-index'>03 / CAREER</span><h2 class='sec-title'>Professional Experience</h2><div class='sec-line'></div>"><span class="sec-index">03 / CAREER</span><h2 class="sec-title">职业经历</h2><div class="sec-line"></div></div>
  <div class="timeline">

    <div class="t-item reveal"><div class="t-time">2025.12 — 至今</div><div class="t-role" data-en="Marketing &amp; Communications Director">市场传媒总监</div><div class="t-org" data-en="Conifer Hotel Sanya (5-star) · Reporting to Director of Marketing &amp; Sales · Team of 3">三亚康年酒店（五星级）· 汇报市场销售总监 · 下属 3 人</div>
      <ul class="t-desc" data-en="<li><b>Brand strategy &amp; communications:</b> led the hotel's overall brand image building and annual communication strategy, anchoring on signature products — the 1,200㎡ rooftop infinity pool and the 70m cantilevered transparent sky pool — to grow brand awareness among younger guests;</li><li><b>Integrated marketing:</b> coordinated online-offline campaigns, led holiday-themed marketing, MICE &amp; event support and event marketing, connecting the funnel of &quot;content seeding — engagement — arrival &amp; conversion&quot;;</li><li><b>New media matrix:</b> managed WeChat, Weibo, Douyin and RED, optimized content production workflows, and built differentiated content around the hotel's landmark status;</li><li><b>Media &amp; KOL cooperation:</b> expanded and maintained KOL and local media partnerships to drive co-created content and exposure.</li><li>Key results: launched the hotel's official RED annual KOL campaign; led the 8th anniversary and Spring Festival creative check-in activities, sparking organic social spreading; took part in the brand promotion of the 6th Asian Beach Games (Sanya 2026), delivering collateral and media coordination.</li>">
        <li><b>品牌战略与传播：</b>主导酒店整体品牌形象塑造与年度传播策略落地，以 1200㎡ 屋顶无边际泳池、70 米高空悬挑透明泳池等核心产品为传播锚点，持续提升品牌在年轻客群中的认知度与市场声量；</li>
        <li><b>整合营销策划：</b>统筹线上线下整合营销，主导节点主题营销、赛事接待配套宣传与事件营销，打通「内容种草—互动引流—到店转化」链路；</li>
        <li><b>新媒体矩阵运营：</b>统管微信、微博、抖音、小红书等平台，优化内容生产与发布流程，围绕网红地标打造差异化传播内容，提升粉丝活跃度与品牌影响力；</li>
        <li><b>媒体与达人合作：</b>拓展并维护达人及本地媒体合作关系，推动高质量内容共创与曝光，强化品牌在垂直领域的声量。</li>
        <li><b>关键成果：</b>策划并落地酒店官方小红书年度达人活动；主导 8 周年庆及春节主题创意打卡活动，强化节日热点与品牌联动，带动社交平台自发传播；参与第六届亚洲沙滩运动会（亚沙会）品牌宣传推广，完成宣传物料筹备与媒体对接，助力赛事期间品牌曝光。</li>
      </ul></div>

    <div class="t-item reveal"><div class="t-time">2025.6 — 2025.12</div><div class="t-role" data-en="Marketing &amp; Communications Director">市场传讯总监</div><div class="t-org" data-en="Swissôtel &amp; Grand Mercure, Yalong Bay Sanya · Team of 2">三亚亚龙湾瑞士及美爵酒店 · 下属 2 人</div>
      <ul class="t-desc" data-en="<li>Owned the hotel's overall brand image and annual communication strategy, continuously growing brand awareness and reputation in the target market;</li><li>Led the planning and execution of integrated online-offline campaigns, focusing on holiday themes and occasion-based marketing to boost engagement and conversion;</li><li>Managed the hotel's new media matrix (WeChat, Weibo, RED etc.), optimizing content production and publishing workflows;</li><li>Built partnerships with travel magazines, KOLs and local media to drive quality content collaboration.</li><li>Key results: unified brand visual &amp; content standards across platforms for standardized brand image management; ran regular UGC campaigns to lift fan participation; launched the &quot;one photo a day&quot; high-frequency publishing strategy.</li>">
        <li>负责酒店整体品牌形象的塑造与维护，制定并落地年度市场传播策略，持续提升酒店在目标市场的知名度与美誉度；</li>
        <li>主导线上线下整合营销活动的策划与执行，重点打造节日主题活动及其他节点性营销项目，增强品牌与用户的互动及转化效果；</li>
        <li>统筹管理酒店新媒体矩阵（微信、微博、小红书等平台），优化内容生产与发布流程，提升内容质量、粉丝活跃度及品牌影响力；</li>
        <li>拓展并维护与旅游杂志、达人及本地媒体的合作关系，推动高质量内容合作与曝光。</li>
        <li><b>关键成果：</b>梳理并优化各平台品牌视觉与内容规范，实现品牌形象标准化管理；定期策划落地 UGC 主题活动，增强粉丝参与感与互动率；推行「每日一图」高频宣发，持续强化品牌记忆。</li>
      </ul></div>

    <div class="t-item reveal"><div class="t-time">2022.1 — 2024.2</div><div class="t-role" data-en="Marketing &amp; Communications Director">市场传讯总监</div><div class="t-org" data-en="Yalong Bay State Guesthouse, Sanya · Reporting to General Manager · Team of 3">三亚亚龙湾迎宾馆 · 汇报总经理 · 下属 3 人</div>
      <ul class="t-desc" data-en="<li><b>Brand upgrade &amp; visual reshaping:</b> led brand diagnosis and strategic upgrade around the &quot;C-position resort of Yalong Bay&quot; positioning; oversaw VI system optimization, key visual refresh and standardized collateral design for unified brand touchpoints;</li><li><b>New media &amp; brand-performance conversion:</b> managed the WeChat / Weibo / RED / Douyin matrix with differentiated content strategies and publishing rhythm, connecting the &quot;seeding — engagement&quot; funnel;</li><li><b>Theme campaigns:</b> planned and delivered annual occasion campaigns (summer family season, Christmas &amp; New Year, Spring Festival), turning the kids' club and underwater restaurant into immersive experiences and social buzz;</li><li><b>Media relations &amp; data-driven PR:</b> built partnerships with travel media, lifestyle KOLs and local news channels, supporting content collaboration and award submissions; introduced PR analytics — sentiment monitoring, media value assessment and campaign performance review.</li><li><b>F&amp;B marketing:</b> designed integrated marketing plans for the underwater restaurant, combining KOL restaurant visits with platform promotions.</li><li>Key results: built Douyin operation from zero, <b>10x follower growth (1K→10K)</b>; created the series &quot;MC Speaks&quot; with 100 short videos, peak single-video UV 22K, <b>3 local trending placements</b>; pioneered the &quot;KOL matrix livestream commerce&quot; model — <b>63 livestreams, self-broadcast GMV ¥3M+, KOL verified sales nearly ¥6M</b>; delivered the Christmas Mermaid themed feast; led F&amp;B packaging upgrade, lifting online conversion via Meituan ROS optimization.</li>">
        <li><b>品牌战略升级与视觉重塑：</b>主导酒店品牌形象诊断与战略升级，围绕「亚龙湾 C 位度假」核心定位，统筹 VI 系统优化、主视觉更新、宣传物料标准化设计，实现线上线下品牌触点的统一输出；</li>
        <li><b>自媒体矩阵运营与品效合一转化：</b>统筹微信、微博、小红书、抖音矩阵，制定差异化内容策略与发布节奏，打通内容种草—互动引流链路，实现粉丝量、互动率同步增长；</li>
        <li><b>主题活动营销：</b>策划落地暑期亲子季、圣诞新年、春节等年度节点性主题活动，结合亲子乐园、海底餐厅等特色资源打造沉浸式体验与社交传播爆点；</li>
        <li><b>媒体关系与数据化公关：</b>建立并维护与旅游类媒体、生活方式 KOL 及本地新闻渠道的合作关系，推动高质量内容合作与奖项申报；引入数据化公关思维，通过舆情监测、媒体价值评估与传播效果数据分析优化媒体投放策略；</li>
        <li><b>餐饮产品整合营销：</b>针对海底餐厅制定整合营销方案，联合 KOL 探店及平台大促活动。</li>
        <li><b>关键成果：</b>从 0–1 搭建抖音运营体系，粉丝量 <b>10 倍增长</b>（1K→10K）；打造栏目「MC 有话说」，全年 100 条短视频，最高单条 UV 2.2 万，<b>3 次登榜同城热点</b>；创新「达人矩阵直播带货」模式，完成 <b>63 场直播，自播 GMV 超 300 万，联动达人总核销额近 600 万</b>；策划执行圣诞美人鱼主题盛宴；牵头餐饮板块包装升级，通过美团 ROS 分数优化助力线上转化率提升。</li>
      </ul></div>

    <div class="t-item reveal"><div class="t-time">2021.8 — 2022.1</div><div class="t-role" data-en="Marketing &amp; Communications Manager">市场传讯经理</div><div class="t-org" data-en="Anpu Hotel, Hangzhou · Reporting to General Manager · Team of 1">杭州安朴酒店 · 汇报总经理 · 下属 1 人</div>
      <ul class="t-desc" data-en="<li>Designed and executed integrated marketing communications strategies, reinforcing the hotel's premium positioning through PR, advertising and promotions aligned with group standards and market trends;</li><li>Owned brand visual consistency — creative review and quality control of all published visuals (online &amp; offline) to meet group brand audit requirements;</li><li>Built strategic partnerships with media, KOLs, communities and key clients; represented the hotel at industry events, press conferences and major marketing programs;</li><li>Planned and executed PR events — brand co-branding, art exhibitions, charity galas — with customized collateral;</li><li>Led the annual communications plan from strategy to execution, exploring innovative formats (short video, livestream, interactive H5).</li>">
        <li>制定并执行整合营销传播策略，通过公关、广告、促销活动强化酒店品牌高端定位，确保与集团标准及市场趋势契合；</li>
        <li>把控品牌视觉一致性，负责所有出街画面（线上线下）的创意审核及品质管理，确保符合集团品牌审计要求；</li>
        <li>建立并维护与媒体、KOL、社区及关键客户的战略合作关系，代表酒店参与行业活动、媒体发布会及大型营销计划，并建立系统化媒体数据库；</li>
        <li>策划执行品牌联名、艺术展览、慈善晚宴等公关活动，结合定制化宣传物料提升品牌美誉度；</li>
        <li>主导年度宣传计划，从策略制定到执行落地，探索创新内容形式（短视频、直播、互动 H5）。</li>
      </ul></div>

    <div class="t-item reveal"><div class="t-time">2020.7 — 2021.6</div><div class="t-role" data-en="Marketing &amp; Communications Manager">市场传讯经理</div><div class="t-org" data-en="Primus Hotel Sanya (Greenland) · Team of 2">三亚悦澜湾绿地铂瑞酒店 · 下属 2 人</div>
      <ul class="t-desc" data-en="<li>Formulated and executed brand PR, advertising and promotional strategies across diversified channels to achieve brand positioning goals;</li><li>Led media relations — long-term partnerships with mainstream media, KOLs and communities; planned and joined large marketing campaigns; built a media database;</li><li>Planned offline PR events and managed design, production and distribution of collateral to ensure unified, high-quality brand visuals;</li><li>Drafted the hotel's annual communications plan; supervised creative design and production of ad visuals, print and digital materials;</li><li>Ran the WeChat / Weibo matrix with innovative content formats, growing fan engagement through data-driven operations.</li>">
        <li>制定并执行酒店品牌公关、广告及促销策略，通过多元化宣传渠道实现品牌定位目标，提升市场知名度和美誉度；</li>
        <li>主导媒体关系管理，与主流媒体、KOL 及社区建立长期合作，策划并参与大型营销活动，建立媒体数据库以优化传播效果；</li>
        <li>策划并落地线下公关活动，统筹宣传物料的设计、制作及发行，确保内容与酒店高端调性及集团标准一致；</li>
        <li>负责酒店全年宣传计划拟定，监督广告画面、印刷品及数字物料的创意设计与制作，确保品牌视觉统一且高质量出街；</li>
        <li>运营酒店自媒体矩阵（微信、微博），创新内容形式与推广方式，通过数据驱动提升粉丝互动率及品牌影响力。</li>
      </ul></div>

    <div class="t-item reveal"><div class="t-time">2014.8 — 2019.6</div><div class="t-role" data-en="Media Planner">媒体策划</div><div class="t-org" data-en="Hainan Sanya Bay Xincheng Development Co. (state-owned real estate)">海南三亚湾新城开发有限公司（央企地产）</div>
      <ul class="t-desc" data-en="<li>Owned media placement analysis and all media coordination — online, outdoor and airport media — with regular placement performance reviews;</li><li>Ran the company's social media presence: official account updates and online campaigns;</li><li>Managed design and production of print collateral;</li><li>Executed marketing events: supported group-level launch events and project grand openings; independently delivered smaller client appreciation and sales-occasion events;</li><li>Produced monthly promotion analysis and marketing cost reports.</li>">
        <li>负责意向投放媒体的点位分析及项目所有媒体的对接与维护工作（网络媒体、户外及机场媒体），定期完成媒体投放效果分析；</li>
        <li>负责自媒体运营工作，包括公众号更新、线上活动等；</li>
        <li>负责项目印刷物料设计及制作工作；</li>
        <li>负责营销活动的执行工作：协助完成集团的大型发布会、项目大型开盘活动，独立完成小型客户体验答谢会及营销节点活动；</li>
        <li>负责月度推广分析报告及营销费用分析。</li>
      </ul></div>

    <div class="t-item reveal"><div class="t-time">2012.3 — 2013.11</div><div class="t-role" data-en="Planner / Sales">策划师 / 销售</div><div class="t-org" data-en="Hainan Longqiwan Development · Hainan Zhongdu Real Estate">海南龙栖湾发展置业 · 海南中度置业</div>
      <ul class="t-desc" data-en="<li>Drafted marketing plans and stage reports; produced monthly promotion analysis covering call/visit data, customer profiles and transaction analysis;</li><li>Wrote and executed project marketing event plans — major sales occasions, client appreciation events and off-island roadshows;</li><li>Coordinated with ad agencies on key visuals, visual extensions and campaign themes;</li><li>Tracked industry policy and market trends; at Zhongdu, handled daily sales, off-island roadshow setup &amp; client reception, and customer profiling.</li>">
        <li>配合营销方案及阶段性汇报材料的撰写；负责月度推广分析报告，包括来电来访数据分析、客户分析、成交分析等；</li>
        <li>负责项目营销活动工作：活动方案撰写及执行，包括大型营销节点活动、客户答谢及岛外推介；</li>
        <li>对接广告公司完成推广主形象及视觉延展的出街、推广主题制定；负责意向投放媒体的点位分析与对接维护；</li>
        <li>负责行业政策、市场监测及分析。中度置业期间：完成日常销售工作，配合推广完成岛外推介会布场及客户接待，配合客户描摹及客户分析。</li>
      </ul></div>

    <p class="t-compact" data-en="Earlier: Anjia Media Group · Copywriter (2011) — real-estate advertorials and industry briefings. Education: Sanya College of Hainan University, B.A. in Tourism Business English (2007–2011); TEM-8, BEC Vantage, New Media Operator Certificate, Agent License.">更早：安家传媒集团 · 文案策划（2011.2–2011.5）——地产广告软文与行业快讯，写作生涯从这里开始。教育：海南大学三亚学院 · 旅业商务英语本科（2007–2011）；英语专业八级（TEM-8）、BEC 中级、新媒体运营师合格证、经纪人证。</p>
  </div>
</section>

